sequenceDiagram
  actor Cashier
  participant BI as Billing
  participant PSP as Payment Provider
  participant AP as Appointment
  participant R as Reconciliation Worker
  Cashier->>BI: issue bill from unique source charges
  alt clinic direct
    Cashier->>BI: POST onsite payment with cashier/shift
    BI->>BI: append balanced journal + allocation
    BI-->>Cashier: internal receipt
  else online (approved merchant mode)
    BI->>PSP: create intent for configured merchant
    PSP->>BI: signed webhook (may duplicate)
    BI->>BI: verify, dedupe, post journal once
    BI-->>AP: PaymentSucceeded event
    opt provider timeout or event delayed
      R->>PSP: reconcile status
      PSP-->>R: authoritative transaction status
      R->>BI: idempotent reconcile command
    end
  end
  opt approved refund
    Cashier->>BI: request with reason, original payment
    BI->>BI: approval, remaining refundable amount check
    BI->>PSP: refund if online, or record authorized onsite refund
    BI->>BI: reversal journal, not destructive edit
  end
